From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:54:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1168/3799] soh: rename func_80ACE7E8 -> EnPart_ReturnToParent

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: sActionFuncs[4]: eases a detached body part back onto its parent's position and rotation, ticking the parent's counter and playing the damage sfx when it arrives, and dies if the parent goes away or recovers.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Part/z_en_part.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Part/z_en_part.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Part/z_en_part.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Part/z_en_part.c
index 273fe99f5..f2573e40b 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Part/z_en_part.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Part/z_en_part.c
@@ -212,7 +212,8 @@ void EnPart_GroundWave(EnPart* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80ACE7E8(EnPart* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80ACE7E8: sActionFuncs[4]: eases a detached body part back onto its parent's position and rotation, ticking the parent's counter and playing the damage sfx when it arrives, and dies if the parent goes away or recovers.
+void EnPart_ReturnToParent(EnPart* this, PlayState* play) {
     Vec3f zeroVec = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
 
     if ((this->actor.parent == NULL) || (this->actor.parent->update == NULL)) {
@@ -244,7 +245,7 @@ void func_80ACE7E8(EnPart* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnPart_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     static EnPartActionFunc sActionFuncs[] = {
-        EnPart_SetupMotion, EnPart_Move, EnPart_SetupGroundWave, EnPart_GroundWave, func_80ACE7E8,  // was func_80ACDDE8 [LLM:HIGH]
+        EnPart_SetupMotion, EnPart_Move, EnPart_SetupGroundWave, EnPart_GroundWave, EnPart_ReturnToParent,  // was func_80ACDDE8 [LLM:HIGH]
     };
 
     EnPart* this = (EnPart*)thisx;
